window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A fallen city. A magical test. A dark deal.</b><br> <br> When we are forced to travel to a forgotten realm, I learn Rene has a history with the dark warlock who runs it. But our host is taken with me and agrees to give us what we came for, provided I agree to his terms.<br> <br> Rene isn’t the only person upset by my decision to entertain the creator of the fallen city, and I end up in a battle for my life.<br> <br> Am I strong enough to protect myself when Rene is caged, or have I fallen into a cleverly laid trap?<br> <br> <i>Find out what prowls the shadows of Black Blossom County by listening to</i> <b>Forty Licks and Still Dead</b>,<i> the new Paranormal Women’s Fiction series listeners are comparing to Shannon Mayer, K.F. Breene, and Victoria Dannan.</i><br> <br> <b>Download now to start this Magical Midlife undead adventure now!</b></p>"; 
